<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,467.80 (1,496.40)	CHF  1,001.10 (1,022.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    854.17 (871.52)	  GBP  2,379.30 (2,440.00)</p>
<p>    ATS    121.34 (124.05)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.28 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$14.08 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $31.36 million ($57.65 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
